flowchart TB
    browser[Browser\nReact TypeScript Vite\nTanStack Query]
    identity[OIDC Provider]
    publisher[Catalog Publisher\nScoped machine credential]
    delivery[Delivery Adapter]
    journal[Independent Durable Journal\nPrivate live host adapter]

    subgraph application[One versioned application]
        http[FastAPI HTTP process\nPython 3.12]
        modules[Identity Organizations Access\nInvitations Catalog Reports Audit]
        policy[Central policy\nScoped queries and use cases]
        persistence[SQLAlchemy 2 and psycopg 3\nOne service owned unit of work]
        worker[Outbox worker process]
        migration[Alembic and migration use cases]
    end

    db[(PostgreSQL 18\nDomain state Sessions Audit\nOutbox Migration ledger)]
    browser -->|Same origin session and typed HTTP| http
    http --> modules
    modules --> policy
    policy --> persistence
    persistence -->|Transactions and composite constraints| db
    http -->|Authorization Code and PKCE| identity
    publisher -->|Catalog operation allowlist| http
    modules -->|Durable prepare before access transaction| journal
    modules -->|Outcome after commit and release| journal
    worker -->|Claim and update delivery records| db
    worker -->|Postcommit delivery| delivery
    migration -->|Versioned DDL and resumable data mapping| db
